    {
      "id": "p0148-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Eventually, the main character goes on a date with Papyrus, although it's actually more like a silly, date-themed battle.",
        "raw": "Eventually, the main character goes on a date with Papyrus, although it's\nactually more like a silly, date-themed battle.",
