    {
      "id": "p0148-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "When this Papyrus dating sequence begins, the English version of Undertale displays the text \"DATI G START!\". Toby noted that this is another reference to Super Matio World, in which each stage begins with the messages \"MARIO START!\" or \"LUIGI START!\".",
        "raw": "When this Papyrus dating sequence\nbegins, the English version of\nUndertale displays the text \"DATI G\nSTART!\". Toby noted that this is\nanother reference to Super Matio\nWorld, in which each stage begins\nwith the messages \"MARIO START!\"\nor \"LUIGI START!\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.61303377,
          0.30637143,
          0.90098127,
