    {
      "id": "p0148-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "With this information in hand, the translator checked the Japanese version of Super Mario World and found that it also displays \"MARIO START!\" and \"LUIGI START!\" in English. For this reason, the translator chose to leave this dating message in English. The phrase was changed to \"DATE START!\", however, as the English word \"date\" already exists in the Japanese language and would be more recognizable to Japanese players.",
        "raw": "With this information in hand, the translator checked the Japanese version\nof Super Mario World and found that it also displays \"MARIO START!\" and\n\"LUIGI START!\" in English. For this reason, the translator chose to leave\nthis dating message in English. The phrase was changed to \"DATE START!\",\nhowever, as the English word \"date\" already exists in the Japanese language\nand would be more recognizable to Japanese players.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29085277,
          0.46324286,
          0.88544921,
          0.56634286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28882111,
          0.46252857,
          0.90816319,
          0.56741429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有了这条信息，译者检查了 Super Mario World 的日语版，发现其中同样用英文显示“MARIO START!”和“LUIGI START!”。因此，约会开始的提示也保留英文，不过改成了“DATE START!”。英语 date（约会）已经作为外来词进入日语，日本玩家更容易认得。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
